WEBVTT

21:02.377 --> 21:04.587
Ain't no doubt about it

21:10.385 --> 21:14.013
I had friends
I had lots of friends

21:14.097 --> 21:17.558
Now all my friends are gone

21:17.643 --> 21:20.895
And I'm doin' the best I can

21:20.979 --> 21:22.813
To carry on

21:24.566 --> 21:26.275
-I had power
-Power

21:26.360 --> 21:28.736
-I was respected
-Respected

21:29.446 --> 21:31.864
But not any more
